{"speciesId":728,"names":{"fr":"Otaquin","es":"Popplio","en":"Popplio","ja":"アシマリ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Connu pour son tempérament de battant, il rassemble l’eau de son corps au bout de son museau en un ballon qu’il projette sur l’ennemi."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Se le conoce por su diligencia y predisposición. Segrega agua por la nariz para hinchar globos con los que golpea a sus rivales."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"This Pokémon snorts body fluids from its nose, blowing balloons to smash into its foes. It’s famous for being a hard worker."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"頑張り屋な 性質で 有名。 体液を 鼻で 膨らませた バルーンを 敵に ぶつける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Ce Pokémon fabrique des ballons remplis d’eau pour se battre. Il ne peut produire un gros ballon qu’au prix d’un entraînement rigoureux."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Maneja con soltura los globos de agua que crea, pero, para poder hacer uno bien grande, necesita practicar sin descanso."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"This Pokémon can control water bubbles. It practices diligently so it can learn to make big bubbles."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"水の バルーンを 操る。 大きな バルーンを 作るため コツコツ 練習を 繰り返す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"À force de s’entraîner quotidiennement, les ballons qu’il gonfle avec son nez grossissent de jour en jour."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Gracias al entrenamiento diario al que se somete, es capaz de inflar burbujas cada vez más grandes a través de la nariz."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"The balloons it inflates with its nose grow larger and larger as it practices day by day."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"鼻で 膨らませる バルーンは 日々 練習を 重ねることで 少しずつ 大きく なっていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il monte sur un ballon d’eau élastique pour effectuer de grands sauts. Son style de combat est on ne peut plus acrobatique."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Monta sobre las burbujas de agua para realizar grandes saltos. Su estilo de combate es bastante acrobático."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Popplio gets on top of its bouncy water balloons to jump higher. It’s quite the acrobatic fighter!"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"弾力性の ある 水の バルーンに 乗って 大ジャンプ。 アクロバティックに 戦うぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il fabrique des ballons élastiques pour se battre. Ils blessent l’ennemi en explosant à son contact."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Crea unos globos especiales muy elásticos que hieren al rival al estallar."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It creates special bouncy balloons to send at its opponents. When the balloons pop, the sheer force of their bursting is what deals damage."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"弾力があり 破裂した ときの 衝撃で 相手を 痛めつける 特別な バルーンを 作る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il s’entraîne sans relâche tous les jours pour réussir à créer de gros ballons de bonne qualité."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Entrena con ahínco a diario hasta que por fin es capaz de crear globos de un tamaño y eficacia adecuados."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"If Popplio want to create big, powerful balloons, they must be persistent. It takes daily practice for these Pokémon to develop their skills."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"毎日 懸命に 練習して ようやく 大きくて 高性能な バルーンを つくれるようになるのだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":728,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"double-slap","learns":[[17,"level-up",29],[18,"level-up",29]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[17,"level-up",4],[18,"level-up",4],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"sing","learns":[[17,"level-up",25],[18,"level-up",25],[20,"level-up",18],[25,"level-up",18]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1